I've had this happen on the OS/2 version of NetHack. Start deleting
files in the bones directory from the last modified. It will cost you
some of the bones you made but it will get you through it. Beyond
that, I know of no solution. Backup your bones files if you want to
make sure you lose nothing. Then when the game doesn't work, go to
your previous backup.

